                                "sense_id": "62e7823d-1517-3992-aa0a-0f5698b508a7",
                                "text": "He insists that it is practically undisputed that, when the ferryboat crossed the bow of the tug to make her slip, she crossed at a distance of at least 300 feet away"
                            },
