                                "example_id": "2237a077-1037-46c9-9973-9d56a1271be7",
                                "sense_id": "62e7823d-1517-3992-aa0a-0f5698b508a7",
                                "text": "It was on this vessel that the founder of the second largest ferryboat company on Puget Sound..."
